      "id": "la-distinct-roots-iff-coprime-derivative",
      "input": "Let $p$ be a nonconstant polynomial over $\\mathbb{C}$ of degree $m$. Then $p$ has $m$ distinct roots if and only if $p$ and its derivative $p'$ have no common root.",
